From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: expose native About my Computer section

The stable extension tree contains the GTK3 About view. Register the GTK4
overlay explicitly after the Activity Manager registration so the preview
cannot construct a GTK3 widget in its GTK4 control panel.

--- a/src/jarabe/controlpanel/gui.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/controlpanel/gui.py
@@ -474,1 +474,14 @@
+        try:
+            import cpsection.aboutcomputer
+            options['aboutcomputer'] = {
+                'alerts': [],
+                'view': 'AboutComputer',
+                'icon': cpsection.aboutcomputer.ICON,
+                'title': cpsection.aboutcomputer.TITLE,
+                'color': None,
+                'keywords': list(cpsection.aboutcomputer.KEYWORDS),
+            }
+        except Exception:
+            logging.exception('Exception while loading GTK4 About my Computer:')
+
         return options
